stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AVAILABLE : Stock Initialized (100 Units)

    AVAILABLE --> RESERVED : atomic_reserve_v1.lua (Stock > 0)\n[300s Ephemeral Lease Granted]
    AVAILABLE --> SOLD_OUT : atomic_reserve_v1.lua (Stock == 0)\n[Immediate HTTP 409 Conflict]

    RESERVED --> PAYMENT_PENDING : Shopper Submits Payment Checkout
    
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED : Payment Authorized (Stripe 200 OK)\n[ACID Order + Outbox Committed]
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> RELEASED : Payment Declined (Card Auth Failure)\n[Lua release returns 1 unit to stock]
    
    RESERVED --> EXPIRED : 300s Lease TTL Timer Elapsed\n[reclaim_expired_leases.lua sweeps]
    PAYMENT_PENDING --> EXPIRED : 300s Timer Elapsed before Settlement
    
    RELEASED --> AVAILABLE : Stock Counter Incremented by 1
    EXPIRED --> AVAILABLE : Stock Counter Incremented by 1
    
    SOLD_OUT --> AVAILABLE : Sweeper Restores Stock from Expired Leases
    
    CONFIRMED --> SOLD : Logistics Fulfillment Dispatched
    SOLD --> [*] : Order Finalized
